        },
        {
          "text": " Naye atafanya hukumu katika mataifa mengi, atawakemea watu wa kabila nyingi; nao watafua panga zao ziwe majembe, na mikuki yao iwe miundu; taifa halitainua upanga juu ya taifa lingine, wala hawatajifunza vita tena kamwe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.2.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.2.4"
            ]
